				<p>
					The "Is It Rolling, Bob? Talking Dylan" podcast has been a recent private project by Kerry Shale. The podcast is/was hosted by the actor Lucas Hare and him. Usually, the episodes were published in a four-week cycle. 
					The podcast is on hiatus since June 2022, after 4.5 years and 80 episodes.
				</p>
				<p>
					Quote: "Actors Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare talk to interesting people about Bob Dylan. And lots of other things."
				</p>
				<p>
					Since the podcast is a project of Kerry Shale and Lucas Hare, they do own the copyright.
				</p>
				<p>
					Due to respect, updates for this specific project page are suspended until December 2024.
				</p>
				<p>
					Please keep the podcast episodes online as long as possible: <a href="https://www.gofundme.com/f/keep-episodes-of-is-it-rolling-bob-talking-dylan-online" target="_blank">Donation Link</a>
				</p>
